      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-07/dangote-aims-to-raise-1-6-bln-in-nigeria-s-biggest-ipo-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">615727ac15c4a4352bfef1b0</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 05:18:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Billionaire Aliko Dangote is seeking to raise $1.6 billion in what would be Nigeria’s biggest initial public offering. Dangote Petroleum Refinery and Petrochemicals FZE is offering 4.1 billion shares at 525 naira ($0.40) each, a company spokesman said Friday. The IPO will open on Sept. 14. Bloomberg's Anthony Osae-Brown reports. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
